<title>UK: RUGBY LEAGUE-LONDON BRONCOS BEAT CASTLEFORD IN SUPER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-LONDON BRONCOS BEAT CASTLEFORD IN SUPER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>London Broncos beat Castleford</p>
<p>22-13 (halftime 13-6) in a Super League match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Castleford - Tries: Richard Gay, Adrian Vowles. Goals: Danny</p>
<p>Orr (2). Dropped goal: Brad Davis.</p>
<p>London Broncos - Tries: Shaun Edwards, Terry Matterson, Josh</p>
<p>White. Goals: Matterson (3), Greg Barwick (2).</p>
